# Marvin client

Marvin client for integrating test line/test control system to Marvin test automation system.  
Used to update test related metadata to Marvin, e.g. test phases and test line data. 

Wiki: https://gitlabe2.ext.net.nokia.com/taca/marvin-client/-/wikis/home
